></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> when all\nleverages are small, and compare with the simulated variance of the\nresidual mean square.</p>","file":"ch09-sums-of-squares/06-expected-mean-squares.html"}